WEBVTT

00:07:29.454 --> 00:07:30.704
because otherwise

00:07:30.871 --> 00:07:35.246
I might end up having people think that
I'm not a good decision maker or I'm

00:07:35.246 --> 00:07:39.163
a loser. I'm not somebody
who's to be trusted.

00:07:39.579 --> 00:07:41.454
The more we've invested in a decision,

00:07:41.829 --> 00:07:47.038
the more attached we become to it and
the more attached it becomes to us.

00:07:47.538 --> 00:07:49.829
This is where an awful lot of

00:07:49.829 --> 00:07:53.579
the real disasters happen in terms
of business decisions.

00:07:53.871 --> 00:07:56.496
People don't want to admit errors

00:07:56.496 --> 00:08:01.954
because their work identity has become
linked with the course of action.